            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe bukungu, mugamburukire abashingantahe. Mwese mukenyere ukwicisha bugufi kugira ngo mukorerane: kukw Imana irwanya abībona, arikw abicisha bugufi ikabaha ubuntu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.5",
